Fadahl is an obtainable Unit in the game. He is one of the Sacred Guardians of Meirith devoted into protecting the Holy Emperor Karna Masta. With a promising potential to be a priest, his dream was crumbled when an incurable disease struck him. It was until he was bestowed with a blessed armor that fully cured him off the disease, he later swore his devotion to the Holy Emperor and became a Guardian.


==Debut Appearance==


==In the storyline==
Fadahl and [[Quaid (character)|Quaid]] were being summoned and ordered to slay a demon named Ragruvord. During the mission, he receives a message from [[Melord (character)|a disciple]] about the dissenters who intend to harm Karna Masta. He then choose to go back to aid Karna Masta with the twins of the group, [[Colt (character)|Colt]] and [[Claire (character)|Claire]]. Shortly after they arrives at the battlefield, they fought the [[Ark (character)|Oracle Knight]] and his party. During the fight, Fadahl receives an injury from [[Yuura|the necromancer]] of the Oracle Knight's party. Shortly afterwards, The Holy Emperor makes an appearance and finishes off Fadahl for good.

